00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.640
commercial contracts. And plenty of

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.480
electrical contractors are

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.240
owner-operators who built something

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:43.120
solid and are looking for the right

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.880
person to hand it off to. When you

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:46.640
