00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:48.760
aging ownership base, you've got a

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:50.680
business that's not just available right

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.840
now. It's about to get harder to staff

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:54.600
and harder to replace. And because so

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:57.200
many of these owners are simply trying

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:59.239
to retire with dignity. Seller financing

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.880
on businesses like this is incredibly

00:02:59.239 --> 00:03:02.920
common. And the best part about the

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.959
electrical industry is that established

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:07.040
electrical contractors are trading for

00:03:04.959 --> 00:03:08.600
