00:03:16.519 --> 00:03:20.360
significantly more valuable as you

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:22.000
continue to grow and scale it. So, the

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.840
next one is really personal for me, and

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.320
that is pools. So, my grandpa and

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.680
